# slug: ch50-recover
# source: chapters/ch50.tex:298
# label: alg:ch50-recover
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch50.tex:301
# caption: Synchronize a failed nonterminal without consuming a caller's delimiter.

REQUIRE failed nonterminal A, token cursor, synchronization set containing end
ENSURE invalid placeholder and progress by popping A or consuming input
emit one diagnostic at the current token
WHILE lookahead is not in the synchronization set DO
  consume one token
END WHILE
discard the pending expansion of A
return an error node without consuming the synchronization token

